1768:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****       (+) Configure Output channels for OC and PWM mode.
1769:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim_ex.c **** 
1770:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****       (+) Configure Complementary channels, break features and dead time.
